1
00:00:01,867 --> 00:00:04,200
Does anyone read? There’s three of us still aboard.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,267
Get us out. I know a way past the blockade.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,300
Coordinates first.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Sending.

5
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:17,667
I’ll hold her. Go!

6
00:00:22,367 --> 00:00:23,567
That ramp will cost you.

7
00:00:25,267 --> 00:00:27,100
I need my Success to save our ship.

8
00:00:27,467 --> 00:00:28,367
I’ll play the Partial.

9
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,067
We take the injury.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,667
Now. Full lateral thrust.

11
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:47,433
Print your deck and play Mighty Decks.
